-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  suite_cli_unknown.pcpp - Test suite: a cli test (pcpp run itself)

  A cli test runs pcpp with its args, in the suite's output root, once, checks
  pcpp's output and exit code (its colours taken out). --no-banner leaves out
  the banner, whose version changes every release; it is read anywhere on
  the line, here after the mistake. An unknown option is a usage error:
  exit 2 and the hint to run pcpp -h. This file itself is never compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe suite_cli_unknown;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--bogus --no-banner"
    exitcode 2
    expect
    | Error: Unknown flag: --bogus
    |
    | Run pcpp -h to see available options
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
